-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ח/3: הסכם שכר קיבוצי עם ארגון המורים בחטיבות העליונות
-- The wage agreement of 14.3.2018 for upper-division teaching employees,
-- as the circular sets it out: it amends the components-merger agreement of
-- 5.9.2017 separately for teachers in the Oz LeTmura reform and for those
-- outside it and principals, raises the counsellor's and new role
-- stipends, adds a mentor stipend, a training-unit cap and a one-time
-- grant, and orders make-up school days for the 2017 strike.
--
-- The agreement's rules are encoded in its own file
-- (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/2018-03-14_oz-latmura_wage-agreement-2017-2022.l4),
-- which this circular imports: a circular applies the agreement and does
-- not re-encode it (MMS-521, MMS-663). Each row of §§2–17 and §18(ב) is
-- cited "as in the agreement of 14.3.2018", by the rule that encodes it
-- there; what the circular says of its own — §1, §14's note on the roles a
-- principal may choose, §18(א), §19's make-up days — is encoded here.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common
IMPORT `2018-03-14_oz-latmura_wage-agreement-2017-2022`
IMPORT minimum_wage_law
IMPORT wage_protection_law
IMPORT womens_work_law

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in salary months from September
-- 2017 (= 1): March 2018 is 7, April 8, May 9, August 12, October 2018 14.

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘משרה מלאה’ and
-- ‘היקף משרה’ here measure the position, as the base of a sum paid pro rata
-- to it or a threshold of eligibility; they set no working hour, day or
-- week, nor the pay of an hour the law counts.

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
-- not on its subject: ‘שכר שווה ערך’ is pay equivalent to the strike hour
-- withheld, for every teacher alike; ‘בעל’ is the holder of a post, not a
-- husband; ‘באב"ד’ is a name in the copies list; none gives pay or other
-- remuneration by sex.

§ `חוזר תשע"ח/3 הסכם שכר בחטיבות העליונות`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, subject, the recital that the agreement was signed on 14.3.2018, and the ministry's address footer; no rule.

-- §1: the agreement governs from 1.9.2017 to 28.2.2022 and amends the
-- components-merger agreement of 5.9.2017 (circular תשע"ח/1).
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement governs on` `the day` IF
    `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017 AND `the day` AT MOST Date 28 2 2022

-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: §6's new §5א(ד) counts the
-- components merger supplement in the wage severance is computed on, and
-- §17(ח) leaves the grant out of it. Which components count, §13 sends to
-- the regulations, which compute that wage by the collective agreement that
-- applies (as the takanon's §1.28.2.3 brings them): a component counted
-- adds to the severance, and for one left out the agreement's word is what
-- the law looks to; §13ב's minimum-wage floor holds whatever is counted.

§§ `2–17, כפי שההסכם מיום 14.3.2018 קובע אותם`

